 "introductions": [
  {
   "type": "image",
   "title": "■ゲームについて",
   "body": [
    {
     "intro": "昔ながらのドット絵とシンプルかつ直感的な操作性のラン&amp;ガンの2Dアクションシューティングゲーム。<br />\r\n敵兵や敵ロボット、変異した虫や植物、そしてトラップを退け敵を倒しながら進め！！<br />\r\n敵の攻撃に当たりダウンした状態で敵に当たると痛い目に…<br />\r\n<br />\r\n=================================<br />\r\nA run-and-gun 2D action shooting game with old-fashioned dots and simple, intuitive controls.<br />\r\nFight off enemy soldiers, robots, mutated insects and plants, and traps as you advance and defeat your enemies!<br />\r\nYou will be hurt if you hit an enemy while you are downed by an enemy attack...<br />\r\n(Translation)",
     "image_info": {
      "url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01361000/RJ01360280/ece9b1bafd4616ceca58a7fb6eaa0091.jpg",
      "alt": "FallenSoldier [NMTgames]",
      "title": "FallenSoldier [NMTgames]"
     },
     "position": "left"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "image_list",
   "title": "■ゲームオーバーシーンやHシーンはアニメーション！",
   "body": [
    {
     "intro": "・Hシーンは<br />\r\n敵29パターン。トラップ4パターンの32パターン！<br />\r\nそれに加えてそれぞれのパターンに速度変化や絶頂、射精などの3段階の進行度含めて96パターンのHアニメーション！！<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n=================================<br />\r\nH-scenes are<br />\r\n29 patterns of enemies. 33 patterns of traps (4 patterns of traps)!<br />\r\nIn addition to that, each pattern has 99 patterns of H animation, including 3 levels of progression, such as speed change, climax, and ejaculation!<br />\r\n(Translation)",
     "image_info": {
      "url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01361000/RJ01360280/4d42ad7203b8298d338471d7f1e06bc2.jpg",
      "alt": "FallenSoldier [NMTgames]",
      "title": "FallenSoldier [NMTgames]"
     }
    },
    {
     "intro": "・敵に捕まりLEWDゲージ(淫乱ゲージ)が溜まっていく。<br />\r\nゲージがMAXになるとワイプの表情が変化！<br />\r\n4回ゲージがMAXになるとゲームオーバーに…！<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n=================================<br />\r\nThe LEWD gauge (lewdness gauge) accumulates as they are caught by the enemy.<br />\r\nWhen the gauge reaches MAX, the expression on the wipe changes!<br />\r\nWhen the gauge reaches MAX 4 times, the game is over...!<br />\r\n(Translation)",
     "image_info": {
      "url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01361000/RJ01360280/679e2bf1d1aedca0cc5b02322906382c.jpg",
      "alt": "FallenSoldier [NMTgames]",
      "title": "FallenSoldier [NMTgames]"
     }
    },
    {
     "intro": "・ゲームオーバーシーンは14種類！<br />\r\n・ゲームクリアイラストも差分含めて2種類！<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n=================================<br />\r\nThere are 14 types of game over scenes!<br />\r\nThere are also 2 types of game-clearing illustrations, including the differences!<br />\r\n(Translation)",
     "image_info": {
      "url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01361000/RJ01360280/deb5ac6f3d3298a3e4bcdd1e06c05fd7.jpg",
      "alt": "FallenSoldier [NMTgames]",
      "title": "FallenSoldier [NMTgames]"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "title": "■その他",
   "body": [
    {
     "intro": "●ステージは全部で4ステージ<br />\r\n・各ステージクリア毎にステージ対応のギャラリーシーン開放！<br />\r\n<br />\r\n●ボイス、効果音、BGMあり<br />\r\n<br />\r\n=================================<br />\r\nThere are 4 stages in total!<br />\r\nA gallery scene corresponding to each stage is opened when each stage is cleared!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nVoice, sound effects, and background music are available."
    }
   ]
  }
